sequenceDiagram
    actor Op as 운영자(대시보드/CLI)
    participant API as fleet-api / fleet-dashboard
    participant Store as fleet-store (agent_commands)
    participant FW as fleet-worker
    participant Tmux as tmux 세션<br/>(fleet-agent-&lt;agent_id&gt;)

    Op->>API: POST /api/agents/:id/terminal
    API->>API: require_permission(AgentRead)
    API->>Store: insert_agent_command(type=capture_terminal, agent_id)
    Store-->>API: Ok(command_id)
    API-->>Op: 202 Accepted

    loop 기존 heartbeat 주기 (기본 15초, #49와 동일)
        FW->>API: POST /v1/workers/heartbeat
        API->>Store: list_pending_agent_commands(host_id)
        Store-->>API: [{command_id, type: capture_terminal, agent_id}]
        API-->>FW: HeartbeatResponse { pending_commands: [...] }
    end

    FW->>Tmux: tmux capture-pane -t <session> -p -S -200
    Tmux-->>FW: 최근 200줄 텍스트
    FW->>API: POST /v1/workers/agent-commands/:command_id/ack<br/>{status: done, result: "<캡처 텍스트>"}
    API->>Store: agent_command.status = done, result 저장

    Op->>API: GET /api/agents/:id/terminal (폴링)
    API->>Store: 가장 최근 done 상태 capture_terminal 조회
    Store-->>API: {result, captured_at}
    API-->>Op: {result, captured_at, stale: captured_at 기준 경과시간}
